+From: PonWrt developers <noreply@localhost>
+Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: accumulate HG5585F hardware account groups
+
+Sample the legacy FE read-clear counters once per second. Publish shared
+group totals separately from per-flow statistics and expose group selectors
+on bound entries. Keep NPU/PPE forwarding and firmware flow stats unchanged.
+
